{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14223010.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223010","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1422301001:0":{"text":"マスター、あそこでドワーフさんが困っているようですよ？","source_cn":"主人，那边好像有矮人在苦恼着什么……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFAEB934EB9A2FE52","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"マスター、あそこでドワーフさんが困っているようですよ？","female":"マスター、あそこでドワーフさんが困っているようですよ？","variant_male_record_index":"165191","variant_female_record_index":"165192","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14223020.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223020","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1422302001:1":{"text":"<male>あんた</male><female>あんた</female>は、ここの来訪者だよな？ちょっとお願いしたいことがあるんだが……","source_cn":"这位<male>先生</male><female>小姐...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4C7B37C062BC7D8D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<male>あんた</male><female>あんた</female>は、ここの来訪者だよな？ちょっとお願いしたいことがあるんだが……","female":"<male>あんた</male><female>あんた</female>は、ここの来訪者だよな？ちょっとお願いしたいことがあるんだが……","variant_male_record_index":"165194","variant_female_record_index":"165195","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422302002:1":{"text":"村に行って、妻と娘の様子を見てきてもらえないだろうか？","source_cn":"能不能回村里帮我看看，我的妻子和女儿过得好不好……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDB4AA8190BCC25A5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"村に行って、妻と娘の様子を見てきてもらえないだろうか？","female":"村に行って、妻と娘の様子を見てきてもらえないだろうか？","variant_male_record_index":"165196","variant_female_record_index":"165197","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422302003:1":{"text":"えっ？この村の出身なんですよね？どうしてわざわざ他人に行かせるのですか？","source_cn":"诶？你原本就是这个村子的人吗？为什么要找陌生人去看呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65672156C68E60D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422302004:1":{"text":"それは、俺が戻ってきたことを知られたくないというか……でも誤解しないでくれ！別に悪いことをしたわけじゃないんだ！","source_cn":"因为我不想让村里的人知道我回来了……别误会！我没干过什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FDD5F56DFD83AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422302005:1":{"text":"ただ……フェリダとターリに合わせる顔がなくて……","source_cn":"我只是没脸见人……我该怎么面对弗瑞达和塔莉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC329FFB62962457E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422302006:1":{"text":"俺は鍛冶職人のハルグだ。三年前、壮大な夢を口にして家を出た。この腕一つで名を上げ、故郷に立派な工房を建てると……","source_cn":"我叫哈尔格，是个铁匠。三年前，我从家里出来的时候满口承...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94F87CAA5A6183AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422302007:1":{"text":"フェリダもターリもすごく応援してくれたよ。ときどき手紙でやり取りしてたんだが、彼女たちは生活の苦労など一切触れてこない。","source_cn":"弗瑞达和塔莉很支持我，虽然她们在信里从不说家里的困难，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F9E945B7B4559A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422302008:1":{"text":"それなのに……俺は財布を空にして帰ってきた。一銭も稼げなかったんだ！","source_cn":"结果我呢，一个子没赚到，兜里空空的就这样回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3634BAA8BE5813A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422302009:1":{"text":"腕があるのにですか？","source_cn":"你不是说你的手艺很好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE97C9385C2209D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422302010:1":{"text":"最初に向かったラスティーアンカーでは、商売がうまくいってたんだ。だが、港が閉鎖され、物価がどんどん上がって、ついに所持金が尽きてしまった……","source_cn":"我先去了锈锚港，刚开始生意还不错，可后来港口封闭了，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E113536A0C97D9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422302011:1":{"text":"港が開放されると、俺は心機一転、仲間を頼ってスノーシダー町に行くことにした。だが、そこの人たちはみんな氷像に夢中で、誰も俺の鍛冶の腕前に目もくれない！","source_cn":"港口解封后，我又去了雪松镇，想投奔在那干活的朋友，可那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABAEC674C63C03AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422302012:1":{"text":"どちらも商売に向かない場所ですね……","source_cn":"每次都刚好去了不适合做生意的地方呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x073058EFD9EC659B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422302013:1":{"text":"俺は役立たずだ！そして村へ戻ってきたはいいが、こうして彼女たちの様子さえ、誰にも聞けないでいる……","source_cn":"可能我就是这么没用吧！如今回到村里我都不敢面对她们……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D9E327C84F1C99E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422302014:1":{"text":"気持ちはよく分かりました……フェリダさんでしたよね？では、まずはロンロンたちが会ってきます！","source_cn":"满满了解你的心情了……你的妻子叫弗瑞达是吗？我们会替你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x740209D5BDB3028F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422302015:1":{"text":"ありがとう！家は村の東にある。元気にしてるといいが……","source_cn":"太感谢了！我家在村子东边，希望她们一切都好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18386B0A4CB01320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈尔格":{"text":"ハルグ","source":"哈尔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14223030.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223030","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1422303001:0":{"text":"ハルグさんの家はこの近くにあるはずですが……誰かに聞いてみましょう！","source_cn":"哈尔格的家是在这附近吗？我们问问周围的人吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5AF14E814D0EDF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14223040.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223040","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223040","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1422304001:1":{"text":"こんにちは！ちょっと聞きたいことが――","source_cn":"你好呀，请问——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F55FF70DCE060C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422304002:1":{"text":"わあー、ハムスターだ！フワフワで……あたしの羊さんたちと同じくらい可愛い！","source_cn":"呀，小仓鼠！毛绒绒的有两只呢……真可爱！和我的小羊一样可爱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E92EB2C95FDDC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422304003:1":{"text":"あなたたちが、村に来てるっていうメイジさん？","source_cn":"你们就是来村里访问的魔法师吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25D0BE9530CA51AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あなたたちが、村に来てるっていうメイジさん？","female":"あなたたちが、村に来てるっていうメイジさん？","variant_male_record_index":"165214","variant_female_record_index":"165215","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422304004:1":{"text":"えっと……私たちはマスターの使い魔で……ちょっと、耳は触らないで……","source_cn":"呃……谢谢……我们的主人是魔法师，我们俩是魔法使魔……...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAD1B096DD1A1EB65","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"えっと……私たちはマスターの使い魔で……ちょっと、耳は触らないで……","female":"えっと……私たちはマスターの使い魔で……ちょっと、耳は触らないで……","variant_male_record_index":"165216","variant_female_record_index":"165217","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422304005:1":{"text":"ほっぺたをつねるのもダメです！それより、フェリダさんを知ってますか？","source_cn":"也别捏满满的脸颊肉！我们想问，你知道弗瑞达家在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27AB19B2DDB1BBC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422304006:1":{"text":"知ってるよ、あたしのママなんだから！","source_cn":"当然知道，弗瑞达是我的妈妈！欸，所以你们要找的是我家吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x732C49D0078A3081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422304007:1":{"text":"ということは……あなたがターリさん！","source_cn":"所以你就是……塔莉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CB57F34E8D061E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422304008:1":{"text":"そうよ、あたしのことも知ってるんだ！それで、ママに何か用なの？","source_cn":"是的，原来你们认识我！你们找我妈妈有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91FCE10429FE7107","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422304009:1":{"text":"別に用ってほどでもないんですが……ちょっと聞きたいことがありまして……","source_cn":"其实也没什么大事，只是想问一些问题……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43EABCCEBF4785FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422304010:1":{"text":"そうそう……「最近どうしてるか」とか、「何か心配事がないか」とか……","source_cn":"比如说……你们最近过得好吗，有没有什么烦恼之类的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46BDAB934DED5F95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422304011:1":{"text":"ふーん、メイジがそんなこと聞いて回ってるなんて……","source_cn":"好新鲜，魔法师竟然会问我这些！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE48C3AB3348CB297","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ふーん、メイジがそんなこと聞いて回ってるなんて……","female":"ふーん、メイジがそんなこと聞いて回ってるなんて……","variant_male_record_index":"165224","variant_female_record_index":"165225","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1422304011":{"text":"ふーん、メイジがそんなこと聞いて回ってるなんて……","source_cn":"好新鲜，魔法师竟然会问我这些！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE48C3AB3348CB297","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ふーん、メイジがそんなこと聞いて回ってるなんて……","female":"ふーん、メイジがそんなこと聞いて回ってるなんて……","variant_male_record_index":"165224","variant_female_record_index":"165225","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422304012:1":{"text":"心配事かぁ……たぶんママに聞いても何もないって言うと思う。でも、あたしは知ってるよ！","source_cn":"烦恼嘛……如果你们直接去问妈妈，她不会说什么的，但我知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x200EE21A51BC97A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422304013:1":{"text